"P4186962103" "Well, the office was torn to shreds, but at least the environmentalists got out in time. And it seems as if some good did come of your efforts after all.  Those Crey operatives were trying to dispose of some files that linked them to some major polluting activities. Countess Crey called personally to thank you for exposing this corruption. She sounded so sad that her trusted employees have been carrying out illegal activities under her very nose."
