// Dialog :
"P1638335908" "You failed to defeat the Council in time to save the Crey lab."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1410111432" "So, the Council was angry that Crey was investigating their super soldiers. I can understand that; after all, they'd hardly want the U.S. military to have access to such powerful technology. Apparently they had inside help, too, from Rupert Pecori, the Cor Leonis you fought. It turns out he mistook you for Council troops, and sends his apologies. You did a good job saving that lab, {HeroName}. If the Crey research is a success, it may give us the tools we need to defeat the Council for good."
// RandomFameString :
"P4294912817" "{HeroName}'s a real friend to Crey Industries."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2034715558" "Well, the police stormed the building and managed to save the scientists, though the lab equipment may never be operational again. They also figured out what got the Council so riled up in the first place. It seems Crey had found a Cor Leonis, Rupert Pecori, who was willing to undergo experiments to help Crey replicate the Council's super soldiers. Naturally, the Council wouldn't take kindly to that. If the Crey experiments are successful, we may soon have the tools we need to defeat the Council for good!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3345298880" "I heard the Council leveled a Crey laboratory."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Crey_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3163390341" "Something terrible has happened over at Crey Industries; one of their scientists has gone mad! Apparently, this Dr. Nichols has developed some sort of genetic mutagen. He was frustrated by Crey's rigorous standards regarding the ethical treatment of human test subjects; finally, he became so frustrated that he used the mutagen on himself. According to Countess Crey, it's totally changed his personality. He's taken several of his colleagues hostage, and he's threatening to kill them unless you come to negotiate his surrender. He says you're the only person he'll trust. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you negotiate the surrender of the mad Crey scientist?</A> You're the only person who can help me on this one."
// AcceptString :
"P110610310" "Negotiate the surrender of the mad Crey scientist"
// SendOffString :
"P1473561217" "Be ready for anything, {HeroName}. You're not dealing with a rational human being here."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P735412134" "Negotiate scientist's surrender"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P534883882" "If you don't go talk to that mad scientist, he's liable to kill his hostages."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3781145131" "Within moments, you realize that this negotiation has become hostile. If you want to save the hostages, you'll have to fight your way through Nichols' followers."

