// Clue Name :
"P4181455785" "The Freakshow's plan"
// DetailString :
"P3228271671" "One of the scientists you rescued told you:<br><br>'The Freaks stole our latest biotech gadget: the cellular regenerator. It was due to appear in hospitals as soon as we got approval. The regenerator repairs human tissue at a phenomenal rate; the Freaks probably want it so they can implant more devices in their bodies and recover from wounds more quickly. They also stole a lot of our data. You could have a hard time fighting them if you don't get it back!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ClueToFreakshowLocation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P101713309" "Freakshow base location"
// DetailString :
