// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AdvancedBiotech 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3858160733" "Cellular regenerator"
// DetailString :
"P3720424701" "You recovered this cellular regenerator that the Freakshow stole from Crey Industries. The scientist you spoke to said this machine was scheduled to appear in hospitals soon, but it looks far more advanced than anything you've seen in Paragon City's state-of-the-art facilities."

