"P1081360895" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to rescue a Crey lab from the Council.</A> They're under siege right now! Those labs have some pretty advanced technology, {HeroName}; I don't think either one of us wants to see it in the Council's hands."
// AcceptString :
"P1799617717" "Rescue the Crey lab from the Council"
// SendOffString :
"P990392233" "The lab tech I talked to sounded pretty scared. Please hurry!"

